      "title": "Google Maps satellite: owner-supplied local reference",
      "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/@13.6461969,123.2337541,80m/data=!3m1!1e3",
      "note": "Inspected owner-supplied ateneo-pacol.png on 2026-10-08; capture date unknown. URL locates the site. Broad northern multi-crown belt and west/south groves, distinguishable crowns in field and drive rows, basketball-edge trees, parking-edge trees, courtyard garden islands, small low green frontage strips and southern courtyard lawn. Northern canopy follows the mapped campus edge and excludes the river/external grove. Tan field patches remain exposed soil; green portions only get grass. Main mapped drive/roofs remain complete. No invented lamps, seats or species. Crown-width observations: North belt: roughly 80-100 px crowns; southwest grove 70-95 px; distinguishable drive/court rows 30-50 px. Large courtyard roof, gym and southern grade-school block all visible. Complete mapped courtyard hole is preserved. Independent excluded check errors: 4.12 m, 3.75 m. Visible crown centers are fitted to clear trunks within the observed crown footprint (maximum seven metres); crowns may overhang roofs and roads. Crown widths in the dense belts are estimated from image pixels against their matched local roof scale; existing circular crowns approximate irregular/elliptical image crowns. Complete mapped roofs, pitches, full-width paths/roads, water and farmland remain unchanged. Planted islands take precedence over exposed paving; ground under opaque canopy is not invented. No surveyed boundary, species, construction date or exact inventory inferred; no bitmap ships."
    }
  ]
